(4) sayfa kabar\uc0\u305 k olmas\u305 n; e\u287 itici, doyurucu, bir felsefesi olsun.\
\
Bu sayfaya \'f6zel felsefe notu:\
\
Felsefe / Ama\'e7: Alan\uc0\u305  sarsan (CD index \u9733 ) ve gecikmi\u351  ke\u351 if (Sleeping Beauty \u9670 ) makalelerin kan\u305 t-bazl\u305  listesi. Felsefemiz: \'f6zg\'fcnl\'fck subjektif de\u287 il \'97 Funk-Owen CD index ve Sleeping Beauty B-coefficient \'f6l\'e7\'fclebilir g\'f6stergelerdir; biz y\u305 llarca offline hesaplatt\u305 \u287 \u305 m\u305 z fact_paper_velocity tablosundan bunlar\u305  g\'f6stereriz. Rakip Scite ba\u287 lam veriyor ama disruption skoru yok; bu sayfada PaperMind imzas\u305  en y\'fcksek seviyede.\
\
Nas\uc0\u305 l Yap\u305 lacak: project_pool paper'lar\u305 n\u305 n fact_paper_disruption (cd_5) ve fact_paper_beauty (b) tablolar\u305 ndan kalibre e\u351 iklerle iki ayr\u305  liste; her \u9733  kart i\'e7in n_a/n_i/n_j \'f6zet bar chart, her \u9670  kart i\'e7in tek-rakam \'f6zet (uyku s\'fcresi t_m, c_max, b skoru). LLM lazy load \'97 kart ba\u351 \u305 na "neden \'f6nemli?" 1 c\'fcmle Flash, kullan\u305 c\u305  t\u305 klay\u305 nca.\
\
CANLI SUPABASE BULGUSU (2026-05-10): fact_paper_disruption \uc0\u10003  aktif (paper_id + pub_year + n_a + n_i + n_j + total_window_papers + cd_5 + cd_undefined). fact_paper_beauty \u10003  aktif (paper_id + pub_year + c_max + t_m + t_a + c_0 + total_cites + year_obs_max + b + b_undefined). fact_paper_velocity \u10003  aktif ama y\u305 ll\u305 k at\u305 f zaman serisi YOK (sadece anl\u305 k velocity + age_adjusted_impact). cd_5 ve b e\u351 ik da\u287 \u305 l\u305 mlar\u305  offline analiz gerektiriyor (canl\u305  sorgu timeout) \'97 Migration plan oturumunda 1 g\'fcn e\u351 ik kalibrasyon notebook'u eklendi.\
\
Eklenecek Dokunu\uc0\u351 lar ve Standart Yay\u305 n Kart\u305 : Klasik ara\'e7larda (SciSpace/Consensus/Elicit/Scite) disruption skoru ve Sleeping Beauty hi\'e7 yok \'97 bu sayfa PaperMind imzas\u305 n\u305 n zirvesi. (1) \u304 ki sekme: \u9733  Y\u305 k\u305 c\u305  | \u9670  Sleeping Beauty (V1 \u10003 , bedava UI): \'fcstte sekme ge\'e7i\u351 i. Felsefe: iki ayr\u305  kavram kar\u305 \u351 mas\u305 n; sayfa kabar\u305 k olmas\u305 n. (2) \u9733  Y\u305 k\u305 c\u305  liste (V1 \u10003 ): cd_5 > kalibre e\u351 ik paper'lar Standart Yay\u305 n Kart\u305  (Daralt\u305 lm\u305 \u351 ); kart \'fcst\'fcnde \u9733  rozet + cd_5 de\u287 eri. S\u305 ralama cd_5 desc varsay\u305 lan. fact_paper_disruption Excel envanter + canl\u305  sorgu kan\u305 t A. (3) \u9670  Sleeping Beauty liste (V1 \u10003 ): b > kalibre e\u351 ik paper'lar Standart Yay\u305 n Kart\u305  (Daralt\u305 lm\u305 \u351 ); kart \'fcst\'fcnde \u9670  rozet + B skoru + uyku s\'fcresi (t_m y\u305 l) + c_max. fact_paper_beauty kan\u305 t A. (4) \'dcst-3 vurgu kart\u305  (V1 \u10003 , bedava UI): her listenin ba\u351 \u305 nda "En \'e7arp\u305 c\u305  3 paper" gradient \'e7er\'e7eve. Felsefe: tarama yorgunlu\u287 u olmas\u305 n. (5) Mikro-yorum lazy load (V1 \u10003 , 1 Flash \'e7a\u287 r\u305  per paper): kart \'fcst\'fcnde "?" simgesi \u8594  t\u305 k \u8594  "Bu paper neden \u9733 /\u9670 ?" 1 c\'fcmle. Otomatik de\u287 il \'97 maliyet kontrol. Felsefe: ham skor \u8594  a\'e7\u305 klama; dan\u305 \u351 man personas\u305 . (6) \u9733  i\'e7in n_a/n_i/n_j \'f6zet bar chart (V1 \u10003 , bedava UI): kart a\'e7\u305 ld\u305 \u287 \u305 nda a/i/j tipleri g\'f6rsel bar chart + cd_5 form\'fcl\'fc etiket. Bireysel "y\u305 kt\u305 \u287 \u305  paper listesi" yok \'97 bu paper \'d7 reference matrisi (~750M sat\u305 r) yeni tablo gerektiriyor, V2'ye kald\u305 . Felsefe: kan\u305 t-bazl\u305  g\'f6rsel; hakem persona. (7) \u9670  i\'e7in tek-rakam \'f6zeti (V1 \u10003 , bedava UI): "12 y\u305 l uyudu, 2018'de uyand\u